SUMMARY:Showstopper! The Podcast – Live Recording
LOCATION:Pleasance Courtyard\, 60 Pleasance\, Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Join The Showstoppers for a live recording direct from the Plea
 sance Courtyard! Showstopper! The Podcast is a monthly chat with stars from
  the worlds of comedy\, musicals and improv. From the people behind Fringe 
 favourite and West End hit\, Showstopper! The Improvised Musical. Previous 
 guests include: improv legend Mike McShane\, viral sensation Rachel Parris 
 and TV personality and musical theatre performer Mel Giedroyc. Last year's 
 live recording featured the fabulous Danielle Steers and Ria Lina – keep 
 an eye on our socials to see who'll be making up songs with us this year!\n
 More info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/showstopper-the-podca
